cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite the following."
title: "CREO: a repair-displacement term for population-based search, and the boundary of its usefulness"
abstract: >-
  Code, campaign scripts and result tables for a within-host ablation of the CREO
  repair-displacement term across eight population-based optimisers, five repair
  geometries, a shifted-optimum control, a moving-target control and a deployed
  rate-constrained tracking loop.
authors:
